{"about_the_game":"Learn HTML and CSS in the context of a 2D puzzle platformer! <i>Super Markup Man</i> teaches real web development practices without making you write any code. Simply carry the tags around the screen and watch your website render in real-time. Match your website with the preview to pass each level. The game includes:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 100 levels/exercises<br></li><li> HTML mode that covers basic tags like A, IMG, STRONG, and EM<br></li><li> CSS mode for more advanced markup and styling<br></li><li> Local co-op*<br></li><li> Optional &quot;bug&quot; setting to keep you on your toes<br></li><li> Free Play mode where you can export levels to actual HTML files</li></ul><br><i>* Note: Only Free Play and CSS Mode support local co-op. Player 2 will also need to use a gamepad (preferably an Xbox gamepad).</i>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"HTML Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/502210/4585adf15e972df31a417b20a8124186249e63b3.jpg"},{"name":"CSS Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/502210/b0df330d61f4eb4212a46bd4675d670814f3d7d5.jpg"},{"name":"CSS Buddies","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/502210/7e1dec4fc06da4e16bef46faa6e1f636c23d86f1.jpg"},{"name":"Practice Time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/502210/cb70ad7d85b137d6c66608fc9fb47a6b8f54268f.jpg"},{"name":"Tag Redo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/502210/b57c8f612099220e58b48d0b87770f19c8b92c7d.jpg"},{"name":"Quick Coder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/502210/2caf14893364f61fa072fcdeeccfc6adfb2041df.jpg"},{"name":"Bug Free","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/502210/b263fca0f27dcd2eda8167a55697917f0945c12a.jpg"},{"name":"Code Reviewer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steams